{"id":"Wf25cfe7a8066f382b036534b","zh":"Z计权因子","en":"","name":"Z计权因子","language":"zh","domain":"铁路动力学、信号与建模方法","concept_id":"C0663bcd36ba666bf5573","families":[],"definition_zh":"计算铅垂向Z振级时对不同三分之一倍频程中心频率加速度级施加的修正因子。","definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":"αi 是与分频振级相加的 dB 修正量，不是无量纲的倍乘系数；修正量按分频定义。","usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"Wf25cfe7a8066f382b036534b","text":"Z计权因子","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"Seabac32b67a1d5034bf8","source_id":"P135","page":4,"page_end":4,"language":"zh","text":"垂向加速度时程信号以 1 s 为间隔计权,分为若干幅波形进行计算分析, 先计算每一幅波形下的各1/3 倍频程中心频率对应的分频振级,再通过下式计算Z振级 [20]: VLZ = 10 log() ∑ i - 1 10(VLi + αi)/10 (2) 式中:VLZ 表示铅垂向Z 计权振级,dB;VLi 为1/3 倍频程中心频率对应的振动加速度级,dB;αi 为 1/3倍频程各中心频率的Z计权因子,dB。","citations":[{"source_id":"P135","page":4,"page_end":4}]}],"sources":{"P135":{"id":"P135","title":"基于车线隧系统的环境振动预测评估方法及参数影响研究","authors":"徐磊,胡逸宁,朱光楠,刘向明,刘虎兵,龙辉,黄厚龙","year":"2025","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.T20240828","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"徐磊等（2025）","overview_slug":"2025-environmental-vibration-prediction-and-evaluation-method-based-on-vehicle-track-tunnel-system-and-ke"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[{"id":"U7da93fe91263987f1e07","unit":"dB","quantity":"Z计权因子"}],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[],"word_links":[{"id":"W194ff0857f428c7859853541","name":"Z-weighting factor","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"参考译法","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"W194ff0857f428c7859853541","name":"Z-weighting factor","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"参考译法","reason":null}],"same_language_synonyms":[],"cross_language_equivalents":[{"id":"W194ff0857f428c7859853541","name":"Z-weighting factor","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"参考译法","reason":null}],"related":[],"related_sources":[{"id":"P135","title":"基于车线隧系统的环境振动预测评估方法及参数影响研究","authors":"徐磊,胡逸宁,朱光楠,